# Regenerable intro VO intermediates (keep beat-*.txt / SCRIPT.txt / scenes.json)
brand/**/intro-video/audio/
brand/**/intro-video/vo/*.mp3
brand/**/intro-video/vo/elevenlabs/
brand/asv-labs-learn/intro-video/audio/
